---
const cards = [
  {
    title: 'Construa sua fortaleza',
    text: 'Posicione muralhas, torres, canhões e armadilhas para criar uma boa defesa.',
    video: '/videos/card-fortaleza.mp4',
  },
  {
    title: 'Monte seu exército',
    text: 'Combine tropas, Heróis, feitiços e Máquinas de Cerco para criar estratégias.',
    video: '/videos/card-exercito.mp4',
  },
  {
    title: 'Ataque com estratégia',
    text: 'Estude a vila inimiga, escolha o melhor ponto de entrada e libere suas tropas',
    video: '/videos/card-ataque.mp4',
  },
  {
    title: 'Lute pelo seu clã e vença o inimigo',
    text: 'Junte seus amigos, participe das Guerras de Clãs e prove que você pode ganhar.',
    video: '/videos/card-cla.mp4',
  },
];
---
<section class="story" id="gameplay">
  <div class="story__stage" aria-hidden="true">
    <video
      class="story__video"
      data-src="/videos/scroll.mp4"
      data-src-mobile="/videos/scroll-mobile.mp4"
      muted
      playsinline
      preload="none"
    ></video>
  </div>

  <div class="story__inner">
    <header class="story__header">
      <p class="story__hat">SUA VILA. SUAS ESTRATÉGIAS.</p>
      <h2 class="story__title">Cada decisão muda a batalha</h2>
      <p class="story__desc">
        Erga uma vila imbatível, forme um exército lendário e enfrente jogadores do mundo inteiro em batalhas épicas. Sua história começa agora, Chefe.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="story__cards">
      {cards.map((card) => (
        <li class="story-card">
          <video
            class="story-card__media"
            src={card.video}
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></video>
          <div class="story-card__body">
            <h3 class="story-card__title">{card.title}</h3>
            <p class="story-card__text">{card.text}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--black);
    /* The stage's negative margin lets it stay pinned for 100svh past the end
       of the section; clip it so it doesn't cover the next one. Unlike hidden,
       clip keeps sticky working. */
    overflow: clip;
  }
  /* Darkens the video only behind the heading; it scrolls away with the text. */
  .story::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    z-index: 1;
    height: 640px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--black) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7) 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Pinned background: stays in the viewport for the whole section while the
     content scrolls over it. The negative margin keeps it out of the flow. */
  .story__stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100svh;
    margin-bottom: -100svh;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .story__video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 80px;
    /* Room for the steps section, which slides up over the end of this one. */
    padding: 112px var(--gutter) calc(112px + var(--steps-overlap));
  }

  .story__header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 665px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .story__hat,
  .story__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .story__hat { font-size: 16px; color: var(--gold-100); }
  .story__title { font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px); }
  .story__desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--white-70);
  }

  /* Cards zig-zag: odd ones on the left, even ones on the right. */
  .story__cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .story-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 347px;
    border: 1px solid var(--white-10);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
  .story-card:nth-child(even) { align-self: flex-end; }
  .story-card__media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .story-card__body {
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }
  .story-card__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .story-card__text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--white-70);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story__inner { gap: 56px; padding-block: 80px calc(80px + var(--steps-overlap)); }
    .story__desc { font-size: 18px; }
    .story__cards { align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
    .story-card:nth-child(even) { align-self: center; }
    .story-card { width: min(347px, 100%); }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { initScrollStory } from '../scripts/scrollStory';
  initScrollStory();
</script>
